                    "caller": {
                      "type": "direct"
                    },
                    "input": {
                      "ticket_id": "42",
                      "body": "Hi there,\n\nI'm sorry you're having trouble with the password reset link! I understand how frustrating that can be. Let me help you get this sorted out.\n\n**Most Common Cause:**\nPassword reset links expire after one hour for security reasons. If you're seeing an error page, the link has likely expired. This is the most common reason for this issue.\n\n**Here's how to fix it:**\n1. Go to Settings > Security in your account (or use the \"Forgot Password\" link on the login page)\n2. Click \"Reset Password\" to request a fresh link\n3. Check your email for the new reset link\n4. Use the link within one hour\n\n**Additional tips to ensure success:**\n- Make sure you're clicking the link from the most recent password reset email (delete any older ones to avoid confusion)\n- Try copying and pasting the link directly into your browser if clicking doesn't work\n- Clear your browser cache or try a different browser if you continue to see errors\n- Check that you're accessing the link on a web browser (password reset is only available on web, not mobile apps)\n\n**Still having trouble?**\nIf you've tried a fresh link and it's still not working, there could be a few other causes:\n- Your email client might be modifying the link - try copying the full URL\n- Browser extensions or security software might be interfering - try incognito/private mode\n- If the error persists, please reply with the specific error message you're seeing, and I'll investigate further\n\nI'm here to help get you back into your account quickly. Please let me know if the fresh reset link works or if you need any additional assistance!\n\nBest regards"
                    },
                    "name": "post_reply",
                    "type": "tool_use"
                  }
